-  <section class="container content-section">
-  <div class="row justify-content-center">
-    <div class="col-lg-8">
-      <dl>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">What should I wear?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">We are confident it will be hot and humid in June in East Tennessee. Please dress accordingly. No need for a tux or ball gown. Dress pants and a collared shirt or a casual dress will be just fine.
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">How do I get to the venue?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">Take exit 407 off I-40 onto TN-66 towards Sevierville/Pigeon Forge. In 8.7 miles, turn right onto W Main Street. In 0.4 miles, turn left onto Hardin Lane. 805 Hardin Lane will be on your right in 1.2 miles.
-
-There is also a map on the <a href="../details">details page</a>.
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">What kind of shoes should I wear?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">This is an outdoor wedding. It might not be the best place for stilettos.
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">Can I bring a date?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">As much as we would love to have everyone, because of venue limitations, please only bring who was addressed on your invitation. If you have a question about this, feel free to contact Nathan or Sarah.
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">When is the RSVP deadline?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">May 8th. And you can RSVP here!
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">What time should I arrive?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">The ceremony is starting at 6pm. Arriving 15-20 minutes early will give you plenty of time to get a seat.
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">I have a pretty seriously allergy to [insert allergen here], can you accommodate me?
-</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">Yes! Get in touch with us ASAP, so we can make sure we keep any [insert allergen here] away from you!
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">Where should I park?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">Parking is on the property. It will be marked and can be seen from the road.
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">Will food be served?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">Yes! We will be having a taco bar with cupcakes and ice cream.
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">Will there be dancing?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">Absolutely! Make sure to fill out the song request option when you RSVP.
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">What time will the reception end?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">We plan on celebrating until about 10pm.
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">Can I take pictures?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">Please no pictures during the ceremony, but take as many as you’d like during the reception. Feel free to tag us and use our snapchat filter and hashtag #OughtToBeAnOrick.
-</p></dd>
-        
-          <dt><h3 class="faq-question">What if I have question that is not listed here?</h3></dt>
-          <dd><p class="faq-answer">Feel free to contact the bride or the groom.
-</p></dd>
-        
-      </dl>
-    </div>
-  </div>
-</section>
